WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.000
Reactants are used up; products are the new substances made.

2
00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:07.376
The reactants are methane and oxygen.

3
00:00:08.201 --> 00:00:12.876
They are used up, and new substances appear: carbon dioxide and water.

4
00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:19.027
The word equation: methane plus oxygen gives carbon dioxide plus water.
